    "updated_at": "2018-02-24T00:54:10Z",
    "body": "Sorry for the very delayed response. FWIW, I agree that we should try to get the rendering more flushed out. I've learned recently for example that Edge fires requestAnimationFrame after updating style and layout and I believe they don't have discrete style/layout phases. So, specifying this might be difficult, but I support doing so.",
